\midrule
Trace records (all three arms) & 1{,}725{,}655 & 2{,}544{,}513 \\
Optimizer update records & 7{,}200 & 7{,}200 \\
Environment replay checks (post-hoc) & 1{,}122{,}403 & 1{,}742{,}570 \\
